<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - S. New England said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - S. New England said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney downgraded Southern New England Telecommunications Corp to neutral from outperform, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed Thursday at 36-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
